    </para>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Installation of libunbound</title>

    <para>
      Make the package compatible with OpenSSL-4 by applying a patch:
    </para>

<screen><userinput remap="pre">patch -Np1 -i ../libunbound-&libunbound-version;-openssl4-1.patch</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Install libunbound by running the following commands:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>CFLAGS+=" -I/usr/include/nss"  \
CFLAGS+=" -I/usr/include/nspr" \
./configure --prefix=/usr      \
            --sysconfdir=/etc  \
            --disable-static  &amp;&amp;

make lib &amp;&amp;
make unbound-anchor</userinput></screen>

    <para>
      Now, as the &root; user:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make install-lib &amp;&amp;
install -vDm755 .libs/unbound-anchor -t /usr/bin/ &amp;&amp;
install -vdm755 /etc/unbound &amp;&amp;
unbound-anchor</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="commands">
    <title>Command Explanations</title>

    <para>
      <option>--with-libevent</option>: This option enables libevent support,
      which allows for the use of large outgoing port ranges.
    </para>

  </sect2>

